WEBVTT

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:08.925 line:0 align:center
Start from a ready-made theme: Midnight, Sand, Carbon, Classic, Aurora, Ember, Glacier and more.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:14.675 line:0 align:center
Auto day and night switches the theme at sunrise and sunset.

00:00:15.025 --> 00:00:17.725 line:0 align:center
Color sets the base colour of the dash.

00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:22.550 line:0 align:center
These settings are shared by the main dash and every sub dash.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.925 line:0 align:center
Background can be a solid colour, a gradient, or a photo.

00:00:27.475 --> 00:00:31.500 line:0 align:center
In Cards, set the shape of the cards and their corner radius.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:39.375 line:0 align:center
Spacing sets the gap between cards, the outer margin and the inner padding.

00:00:40.725 --> 00:00:46.300 line:0 align:center
Under Text and labels, Card titles shows or hides the small captions, like SPEED.

00:00:47.025 --> 00:00:50.875 line:0 align:center
Click Use the theme's style to put the theme's settings back.

00:00:52.925 --> 00:00:57.050 line:0 align:center
Pick a shape, like Soft or Cut, then drag Corner radius.

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:02.475 line:0 align:center
Sharp or round corners: it's your call.
